This directory holds datasets exactly as downloaded. It is IMMUTABLE.

Never edit a file in here by hand. Everything downstream (data/interim, data/processed)
must be regenerated from these files by script. That is what makes the "fully reproducible"
requirement true rather than aspirational, and it stops four people corrupting each
other's inputs.

Contents are gitignored -- they are re-fetched by src/acquire/.

This file exists only because git does not track empty directories.
